This license covers the code and written analysis in this repository. It does
NOT cover:
  - The original "Hidden Stylistic Schools of Pre-Islamic Poetry" pipeline
    design and text (Othman & Qranfal, Wentworth Institute of Technology,
    submitted IEEE ICAD 2026), reproduced here under `reference/` for
    attribution and reproducibility — see that directory's own LICENSE.
  - `data/poems.db`, whose poem text was originally compiled from
    Aldiwan.net (see `data/README.md` for the same data-provenance caution
    the original authors' README expresses).
  - The Qur'anic text served by the Al Quran Cloud API, which this project
    fetches at runtime rather than redistributing.
